10
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
M3GAN 2.0 is a 2025 American science fiction action film written and directed
by Gerard Johnstone from a story he co-wrote with Akela Cooper.

11
01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:26,000
A sequel to the 2022 film M3GAN and the second installment in the M3GAN franchise, the film stars Allison Williams, Violet McGraw,
Ivanna Sakhno, and Jemaine Clement, with Amie Donald physically portraying M3GAN while Jenna Davis voices the character.

12
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
Jason Blum and James Wan return as producers under their respective
Blumhouse Productions and Atomic Monster companies.

13
01:26:40,000 --> 01:26:46,000
It follows M3GAN being rebuilt to combat a humanoid military robot built
using M3GAN's technology that is attempting an AI takeover.

14
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:26,000
M3GAN 2.0 premiered in New York on June 24, 2025, and was released
in North America by Universal Pictures on June 27.

15
01:40:00,000 --> 01:40:06,000
The film received mixed reviews from critics and has grossed
$39.1 million against a budget of $15–25 million.

16
01:46:40,000 --> 01:46:46,000
The film explores themes of android, artificial
intelligence (a.i.), fight, killer robot, beheading.

17
01:53:20,000 --> 01:53:26,000
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
